**9.6.17** \(K_{0}(z)\!=\!-\!\frac{1}{\pi}\int_{0}^{\pi}e^{\pm z\cos\theta}\left\{\gamma+ \ln\,(2z\sin^{2}\theta)\right\}d\theta\)

**9.6.18**

\(I_{v}(z)\!=\!\!\frac{(\frac{1}{2}z)^{v}}{\pi^{\frac{1}{2}}\Gamma(v\!+\!\frac{1 }{2})}\int_{0}^{\circ\pi}e^{\pm z\cos\theta}\sin^{2v}\theta d\theta\)

\(\!=\!\!\frac{(\frac{1}{2}z)^{v}}{\pi^{\frac{1}{2}}\Gamma(v\!+\!\frac{1}{2})} \int_{-1}^{1}(1\!-\!t^{2})^{v-\frac{1}{2}}e^{\pm zt}dt\) (\(\cancel{\Delta v}\!>\!-\frac{1}{2}\))

9.6.19\(I_{n}(z)\)=\(\frac{1}{\pi}\int_{0}^{\pi}e^{z\cos\theta}\cos\ (n\theta)d\theta\)

9.6.20\(I_{r}(z)\)=\(\frac{1}{\pi}\int_{0}^{\pi}e^{z\cos\theta}\cos\ (\nu\theta)d\theta\)

\(-\frac{\sin\ (\nu\pi)}{\pi}\int_{0}^{\infty}e^{-z\cosh\ t-vt}dt\qquad(|\arg\ z|< \frac{1}{2}\pi)\)

9.6.21\(K_{0}(x)\)=\(\int_{0}^{\infty}\cos\ (x\sinh\ t)dt\)=\(\int_{0}^{\infty}\frac{\cos\ (xt)}{\sqrt{t^{2}+1}}\,dt\)

9.6.22\(K_{r}(x)\)=sec\((\frac{1}{2}\nu\pi)\int_{0}^{\infty}\cos\ (x\sinh\ t)\ cosh\ (\nu t)dt\)

\(=\)csc\((\frac{1}{2}\nu\pi)\int_{0}^{\infty}\sin\ (x\sinh\ t)\ sinh\ (\nu t)dt\)

\((|\mathscr{D}_{\nu}|<\)1, \(x>\)0)

9.6.23\(K_{r}(z)\)=\(\frac{\pi^{1}(\frac{1}{2}z)^{r}}{\Gamma(\nu+\frac{1}{2})}\int_{0}^{\infty}e^{-z\cosh t }\sinh^{2\nu}t\ dt\)

\(=\)\(\frac{\pi^{1}(\frac{1}{2}z)^{r}}{\Gamma(\nu+\frac{1}{2})}\int_{1}^{\infty}e^{-zt}(t^{2} = 1)^{\nu-1}\ dt\)

\((\mathscr{D}_{\nu}>\)-\(\frac{1}{2}\), \(|\arg\ z|<\frac{1}{2}\pi)\)

9.6.24\(K_{r}(z)\)=\(\int_{0}^{\infty}e^{-z\cosh t}\cosh\ (\nu t)\,dt\ (|\arg\ z|<\frac{1}{2}\pi)\)

9.6.25\(K_{r}(xz)\)=\(\frac{\Gamma(\nu+\frac{1}{2})(2z)^{r}}{\pi^{1}x^{p}}\)\(\int_{0}^{\infty}\frac{\cos\ (xt)dt}{(t^{2}+z^{2})^{r+1}}\)

\((\mathscr{D}_{\nu}\geq-\frac{1}{2}\), \(x>\)0, \(|\arg\ z|<\frac{1}{2}\pi)\)

**Reurrence Relations**

9.6.26\(\mathscr{L}_{\nu-1}(z)\)-\(\mathscr{L}_{\nu+1}(z)\)=\(\frac{2\nu}{z}\mathscr{L}_{\nu}(z)\)

\(\mathscr{L}_{\nu}^{\prime}(z)\)=\(\mathscr{L}_{\nu-1}(z)\)-\(\frac{\nu}{z}\mathscr{L}_{\nu}(z)\)

\(\mathscr{L}_{\nu-1}(z)\)+\(\mathscr{L}_{\nu+1}(z)\)=\(2\mathscr{L}_{\nu}^{\prime}(z)\)

\(\mathscr{L}_{\nu}^{\prime}(z)\)=\(\mathscr{L}_{\nu+1}(z)\)+\(\frac{\nu}{z}\mathscr{L}_{\nu}(z)\)



**Over the Universe**

\({\cal L}\), denotes \(I_{v}\), \(e^{v\pi t}K\), or any linear combination of these functions, the coefficients in which are independent of \(z\) and \(v\).
